VD2aqytpMD1HZdxUxfBPZIrwuZya8Lmck\"/><figcaption>如何避免黃麴毒素中毒？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何避免黃麴毒素中毒？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220826/639797980056915968324890.jpeg/efUsYfQ-oMbdIti5BjlViZr5YfsMdueOe6bRdnum0XY\"/><figcaption>如何避免黃麴毒素中毒？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>吃進黴菌毒素不一定能排掉！研究揭脂肪可能成「倉庫」</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>「本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T09:20:44.552483+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1741,"images":32,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}